  "natspec": {
    "functions": {
      "0x49160658": {
        "notice": "Axelar inbound entrypoint. Validates the approved call + the source gateway, then delivers to the ERC-7786 recipient. Called by the Axelar relayer."
      },
      "0x116191b6": {
        "notice": "The configured Axelar gateway contract."
      },
      "0x207b5e03": {
        "notice": "Returns the Axelar chain name for a \"chain-only\" ERC-7930 interoperable address."
      },
      "0x5a4cb606": {
        "notice": "Returns the \"chain-only\" ERC-7930 interoperable address for an Axelar chain name."
      },
      "0xef382213": {
        "notice": "Returns the trusted remote gateway address-bytes registered for a \"chain-only\" address."
      },
      "0xbaf454d2": {
        "notice": "Registers a CAIP-2 ↔ Axelar chain-name equivalence (both directions). Admin only.",
        "params": {
          "axelar": "The Axelar chain name (e.g. \"ethereum\", \"optimism\").",
          "chain": "A \"chain-only\" ERC-7930 interoperable address (empty address part)."
        }
      },
      "0xcb6782b2": {
        "notice": "Registers a trusted remote gateway adapter. Admin only.",
        "params": {
          "remote": "The full ERC-7930 interoperable address of the remote adapter (chain + address)."
        }
      },
      "0xcdfe7f5c": {
        "dev": "Endpoint for creating a new message. If the message requires further (gateway specific) processing before it can be sent to the destination chain, then a non-zero `sendId` must be returned. Otherwise, the message MUST be sent and this function must return 0. * MUST emit a {MessageSent} event. If any of the `attributes` is not supported, this function SHOULD revert with an {UnsupportedAttribute} error. Other errors SHOULD revert with errors not specified in ERC-7786."
      },
      "0xdc680a0f": {
        "dev": "Getter to check whether an attribute is supported or not."
      }
    },
    "notice": "Dual-mode ERC-7786 gateway facet over Axelar GMP: `sendMessage` (source) emits an Axelar `callContract`; `execute` (destination, called by the Axelar relayer) validates the approved call + the trusted source gateway, then delivers to the ERC-7786 recipient. EVM chains only.",
    "dev": "Stateless delegator — logic/storage live in {AxelarGatewayAdapterLib}. OZ's `immutable` Axelar gateway + `Ownable` are converted to ERC-7201 storage + AccessControl for the Diamond."
  },
